  "description": "TerrariaRuntime is a low-level Terraria integration layer that rewrites the official server assembly and exposes generated runtime hooks. It is derived from Open Terraria API and carries a server-only .NET 11 baseline with narrowly scoped compatibility and performance work.\n\n        The server package targets .NET 11 and provides the TerrariaRuntime and TerrariaRuntime.Hooks assemblies.",
